{"seq":3,"slug":"session-management","title":"会话管理工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/identity-platform-oauth/architecture/session-management","wordCount":1529,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"会话管理工程\">会话管理工程</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>会话管理围绕三组核心问题：层次模型（IdP Session、RP Session、Token State 三层独立但关联的生命周期）、存储架构（分布式环境下一致性与性能的取舍）、同步机制（登出传播的可靠性与延迟）。IdP Session 是信任锚——它的终止必须能在可接受的延迟内传播到所有派生的 RP Session。</p>\n<h2 id=\"会话的本质与层次模型\">会话的本质与层次模型</h2><p>「会话」是认证状态在时间维度上的延伸——用户完成一次认证后，系统在一段时间内「记住」这个认证事实，避免每次操作都重新验证。在分布式身份系统中，会话存在于多个层次，每层有独立的生命周期和管理机制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>会话层次</th>\n<th>持有者</th>\n<th>表现形式</th>\n<th>生命周期控制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>IdP SSO Session</td>\n<td>授权服务器</td>\n<td>Session Cookie（HttpOnly, Secure）</td>\n<td><code>max_age</code> / 绝对超时 / 滑动超时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RP Application Session</td>\n<td>应用服务器</td>\n<td>Session ID Cookie / 加密会话</td>\n<td>应用自定义策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Token-based State</td>\n<td>客户端</td>\n<td>Access Token + Refresh Token</td>\n<td>Token TTL / 轮转 / 吊销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Browser State</td>\n<td>浏览器</td>\n<td>LocalStorage / SessionStorage / Cookie</td>\n<td>页面生命周期 / 用户清除</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户首次登录] --&gt; B[IdP 创建 SSO Session]&#10;    B --&gt; C[签发 Token 给 RP-A]&#10;    B --&gt; D[签发 Token 给 RP-B]&#10;    C --&gt; E[RP-A 创建 App Session]&#10;    D --&gt; F[RP-B 创建 App Session]&#10;&#10;    G[用户从 IdP 登出] --&gt; H[IdP 销毁 SSO Session]&#10;    H --&gt; I[Back-Channel Logout 通知 RP-A]&#10;    H --&gt; J[Back-Channel Logout 通知 RP-B]&#10;    I --&gt; K[RP-A 销毁 App Session]&#10;    J --&gt; L[RP-B 销毁 App Session]\">graph TD\n    A[用户首次登录] --&gt; B[IdP 创建 SSO Session]\n    B --&gt; C[签发 Token 给 RP-A]\n    B --&gt; D[签发 Token 给 RP-B]\n    C --&gt; E[RP-A 创建 App Session]\n    D --&gt; F[RP-B 创建 App Session]\n\n    G[用户从 IdP 登出] --&gt; H[IdP 销毁 SSO Session]\n    H --&gt; I[Back-Channel Logout 通知 RP-A]\n    H --&gt; J[Back-Channel Logout 通知 RP-B]\n    I --&gt; K[RP-A 销毁 App Session]\n    J --&gt; L[RP-B 销毁 App Session]</pre><p>关键设计原则：<strong>IdP Session 是信任锚，RP Session 是派生物</strong>。当 IdP Session 终止时，所有派生的 RP Session 都应在可接受的延迟内终止。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分布式会话存储架构\">分布式会话存储架构</h2><p>单机内存存储在生产环境中不可行——任何实例重启都会导致大量用户被强制重新登录。分布式会话存储需要在一致性、可用性和性能之间做出明确取舍。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>存储方案</th>\n<th>一致性</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>持久性</th>\n<th>适用规模</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Redis Cluster</td>\n<td>最终一致（异步复制）</td>\n<td>亚毫秒</td>\n<td>AOF/RDB 持久化</td>\n<td>百万级并发会话</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加密 Cookie（客户端存储）</td>\n<td>强一致（无服务端状态）</td>\n<td>零延迟</td>\n<td>随浏览器生命周期</td>\n<td>无状态架构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关系数据库</td>\n<td>强一致</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n<td>完全持久</td>\n<td>中等规模 + 审计需求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DynamoDB / Bigtable</td>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n<td>低延迟</td>\n<td>完全持久</td>\n<td>超大规模全球部署</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>加密 Cookie 方案的细节</strong>：将会话数据序列化后用 AES-256-GCM 加密，密文作为 cookie 值存储在客户端。服务端完全无状态——每个请求自带会话数据。优势是水平扩展无瓶颈；劣势是无法服务端主动注销（只能等 cookie 过期或密钥轮转）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sso-session-的生命周期策略\">SSO Session 的生命周期策略</h2><p>SSO Session 的超时策略直接影响安全性与用户体验：</p>\n<p><strong>绝对超时（Absolute Timeout）</strong>：无论用户是否活跃，Session 在创建后固定时间到期。确保认证的新鲜度——即使设备被遗留在解锁状态，攻击窗口也有上界。</p>\n<p><strong>滑动超时（Sliding Timeout）</strong>：每次用户活动重置超时计时器。提供更好的用户体验（活跃用户不被打断），但如果设备被物理窃取，攻击者可以通过持续活动无限延长会话。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐组合策略</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Session 有效</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>idle_time</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>age</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>auth_time</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>now 对高危操作</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Session 有效} = (\\text{idle\\_time} &lt; T_{idle}) \\wedge (\\text{age} &lt; T_{absolute}) \\wedge (\\text{auth\\_time} + T_{reauth} &gt; \\text{now 对高危操作})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Session </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有效</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">idle_time</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">age</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">so</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">auth_time</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">now </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">对高危操作</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略参数</th>\n<th>推荐值（通用 SaaS）</th>\n<th>推荐值（金融/医疗）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>滑动超时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{idle}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>30 分钟</td>\n<td>15 分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绝对超时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{absolute}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">so</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>8 小时</td>\n<td>4 小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强制重认证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{reauth}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>24 小时</td>\n<td>1 小时（高危操作）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"单点登录-sso-的实现机制\">单点登录（SSO）的实现机制</h2><p>SSO 允许用户在一次认证后访问多个应用而无需重复登录。其工作原理依赖 IdP Session Cookie 的存在：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>用户访问 App-A → App-A 重定向到 IdP</li>\n<li>IdP 检查 SSO Session Cookie → 不存在 → 显示登录界面</li>\n<li>用户完成认证 → IdP 创建 SSO Session → 签发令牌给 App-A → 设置 Session Cookie</li>\n<li>用户访问 App-B → App-B 重定向到 IdP</li>\n<li>IdP 检查 SSO Session Cookie → <strong>存在且有效</strong> → 跳过登录 → 直接签发令牌给 App-B</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant User as 用户&#10;    participant AppA as App A&#10;    participant IdP as IdP&#10;    participant AppB as App B&#10;&#10;    User-&gt;&gt;AppA: 访问受保护资源&#10;    AppA-&gt;&gt;IdP: 重定向 /authorize&#10;    IdP-&gt;&gt;User: 登录页面&#10;    User-&gt;&gt;IdP: 提交凭证&#10;    IdP-&gt;&gt;IdP: 创建 SSO Session&lt;br/&gt;设置 Session Cookie&#10;    IdP-&gt;&gt;AppA: 返回 code&#10;    AppA-&gt;&gt;IdP: 交换 token&#10;&#10;    Note over User,AppB: 稍后...&#10;&#10;    User-&gt;&gt;AppB: 访问受保护资源&#10;    AppB-&gt;&gt;IdP: 重定向 /authorize&#10;    IdP-&gt;&gt;IdP: 检测到 SSO Session Cookie&lt;br/&gt;Session 有效&#10;    IdP-&gt;&gt;AppB: 直接返回 code(无需登录)&#10;    AppB-&gt;&gt;IdP: 交换 token\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant AppA as App A\n    participant IdP as IdP\n    participant AppB as App B\n\n    User-&gt;&gt;AppA: 访问受保护资源\n    AppA-&gt;&gt;IdP: 重定向 /authorize\n    IdP-&gt;&gt;User: 登录页面\n    User-&gt;&gt;IdP: 提交凭证\n    IdP-&gt;&gt;IdP: 创建 SSO Session&lt;br/&gt;设置 Session Cookie\n    IdP-&gt;&gt;AppA: 返回 code\n    AppA-&gt;&gt;IdP: 交换 token\n\n    Note over User,AppB: 稍后...\n\n    User-&gt;&gt;AppB: 访问受保护资源\n    AppB-&gt;&gt;IdP: 重定向 /authorize\n    IdP-&gt;&gt;IdP: 检测到 SSO Session Cookie&lt;br/&gt;Session 有效\n    IdP-&gt;&gt;AppB: 直接返回 code(无需登录)\n    AppB-&gt;&gt;IdP: 交换 token</pre><p><strong>SSO 在第三方 Cookie 限制下的挑战</strong>：现代浏览器逐步限制第三方 Cookie。当 IdP 与 RP 不同源时，SSO Session Cookie 可能被阻止。解决方案包括：同源子域部署、Token Mediator Pattern（通过顶层导航而非 iframe 传递认证状态）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"登出传播与会话同步\">登出传播与会话同步</h2><p>登出是会话管理中最复杂的操作——需要在所有相关方之间同步状态变更。OIDC 定义了三种登出机制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>传播方式</th>\n<th>可靠性</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>推荐度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RP-Initiated Logout</td>\n<td>用户浏览器重定向到 IdP</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n<td>推荐作为入口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Front-Channel Logout</td>\n<td>iframe 加载 RP logout URL</td>\n<td>低（第三方 Cookie 限制）</td>\n<td>即时但不可靠</td>\n<td>已过时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Back-Channel Logout</td>\n<td>IdP 服务端 POST Logout Token</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>强烈推荐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Back-Channel Logout Token 结构</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;iss&quot;: &quot;https://idp.example.com&quot;,&#10;  &quot;sub&quot;: &quot;user-123&quot;,&#10;  &quot;aud&quot;: &quot;client-app-a&quot;,&#10;  &quot;iat&quot;: 1720000000,&#10;  &quot;jti&quot;: &quot;unique-logout-event-id&quot;,&#10;  &quot;events&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;http://schemas.openid.net/event/backchannel-logout&quot;: {}&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;sid&quot;: &quot;session-abc-456&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"iss\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://idp.example.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sub\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user-123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"aud\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"client-app-a\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"iat\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1720000000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"jti\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"unique-logout-event-id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"events\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"http://schemas.openid.net/event/backchannel-logout\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"session-abc-456\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>RP 收到 Logout Token 后的处理流程：验证签名 → 检查 <code>iss</code>/<code>aud</code> → 根据 <code>sub</code> 或 <code>sid</code> 查找本地会话 → 标记会话无效 → 返回 200 确认。</p>\n<h2 id=\"会话固定与会话劫持防御\">会话固定与会话劫持防御</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>攻击类型</th>\n<th>攻击原理</th>\n<th>防御措施</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>会话固定（Session Fixation）</td>\n<td>攻击者预设一个 Session ID，诱导用户使用它登录</td>\n<td>认证成功后必须重新生成 Session ID</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话劫持（Session Hijacking）</td>\n<td>通过 XSS/网络嗅探窃取 Session Cookie</td>\n<td>Cookie 标记 HttpOnly + Secure + SameSite=Lax</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话重放</td>\n<td>重放已注销的 Session Cookie</td>\n<td>注销时服务端删除会话记录 + Cookie 标记过期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CSRF 利用会话</td>\n<td>利用浏览器自动附带 Cookie 的行为</td>\n<td>SameSite Cookie + CSRF Token 双重防御</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>会话管理的核心挑战在于跨多个系统维护认证状态的一致性。SSO 的便利性与登出传播的可靠性之间存在天然张力——2026 年的最佳实践是：绝对超时 + 滑动超时的组合策略限制会话生命期，Back-Channel Logout 实现可靠的服务端登出传播，短 TTL Access Token 作为登出传播延迟的安全兜底。第三方 Cookie 限制迫使 SSO 实现向同源部署或 Token Mediator 模式演进。</p>\n<p><strong>相关文档</strong>：<a href=\"idp-architecture\">身份提供者架构设计</a> 描述了会话管理器在 IdP 架构中的位置与职责；<a href=\"token-management\">令牌管理与生命周期</a> 解释了令牌状态与会话状态的协调关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"会话管理工程","id":"会话管理工程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"会话的本质与层次模型","id":"会话的本质与层次模型"},{"level":2,"text":"分布式会话存储架构","id":"分布式会话存储架构"},{"level":2,"text":"SSO Session 的生命周期策略","id":"sso-session-的生命周期策略"},{"level":2,"text":"单点登录（SSO）的实现机制","id":"单点登录-sso-的实现机制"},{"level":2,"text":"登出传播与会话同步","id":"登出传播与会话同步"},{"level":2,"text":"会话固定与会话劫持防御","id":"会话固定与会话劫持防御"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"令牌管理与生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/identity-platform-oauth/architecture/token-management"},"next":{"title":"OAuth 协议威胁模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/identity-platform-oauth/security/oauth-threat-model"}}